\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Confidence signal comparison across three NER datasets ($N$=8, $T$=0.7 for consistency signals; Qwen3-8B). Bold marks the best signal per dataset-metric. \textsc  {SJ}{} is the best consistency-based signal on all datasets; \textsc  {LogProb}{} is competitive and wins on CoNLL-2003. The rightmost column reports bootstrap $p$-values for \textsc  {SJ}{} vs each signal on WNUT-17.}}{4}{table.caption.15}\protected@file@percent }
